# HypoExplorer build-time env. Copy to .env.local (gitignored via *.local).
#
# These are BUILD-time values, baked into the bundle by Vite — there is no deploy
# platform that could supply them. Production is built on a developer's machine
# and published with `pnpm run deploy:cf`; the Worker is assets-only and executes
# no code, so it reads no environment at all. A build made without .env.local
# compiles to same-origin and ships a broken data path; version.json records the
# origin it was built against and verify:deploy fails on the mismatch.

# Origin that serves the data trees — public/datasets/**, public/query/** AND
# public/qc/**. Empty = app-relative (they ship from the app host). Set to a
# Cloudflare R2 / CDN origin to serve them off-origin with no code changes —
# every loader prepends this. Use a bare origin, no trailing slash (the file
# templates are absolute /datasets/... paths).
#
# Production MUST be an R2 custom domain, not the pub-*.r2.dev URL: r2.dev is
# rate-limited/dev-only and bypasses the Cloudflare edge cache, and the upload
# script stores objects brotli-encoded (Content-Encoding: br) — only the custom-
# domain proxy transcodes that for clients that don't accept br.
#   e.g. VITE_BUNDLE_BASE_URL=https://data.yourdomain.org   (R2 custom domain)
#        VITE_BUNDLE_BASE_URL=https://pub-xxxxxxxx.r2.dev   (dev testing only)
VITE_BUNDLE_BASE_URL=

# Set to "true" only if the bundle origin above sends Access-Control-Allow-Origin.
#
# The app shows a byte-level progress bar while a data bundle downloads, which
# needs a streaming fetch(). Same-origin bundles (empty base URL above) always
# stream. Cross-origin they need CORS on the bucket, so this is declared rather
# than probed: an optimistic guess that turns out wrong costs a wasted download
# of every bundle (the browser pulls the bytes before rejecting the response),
# while leaving it off just means the bar is indeterminate instead of a
# percentage. Nothing else about loading changes either way.
#
# For R2: add a CORS policy allowing GET from the app's origin, then set this.
VITE_BUNDLE_CORS=
